### 1. Create a Person
POST {{url}}/people
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "content": "A close friend and companion.",
  "relation": "FRIEND",
  "visibility": "PRIVATE"
}

### 1. Create second Person
POST {{url}}/people
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John smith",
  "content": "family member.",
  "relation": "BROTHER",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

###

### 2. Get All People
GET {{url}}/people
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get Person by ID
GET {{url}}/people/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Get Random Person
GET {{url}}/people/random
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Update a Person
PUT {{url}}/people/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "content": "Updated notes about Jane.",
  "relation": "MOTHER",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

###

### 6. Delete a Person
DELETE {{url}}/people/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json